{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000001", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you send them even the perfect options, the client just disappears.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000001"}, {"quote": "every client who disappears like this costs you thirty, fifty, maybe sixty thousand dirhams.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000002"}], "text": "Clients often disappear after being presented with options, leading to loss of potential deals and financial cost."}, "title": "Client Disappearing in Real Estate Deals", "topic": "client_disappearing"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:8945382bc0cbaaa1", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Client Disappearing in Real Estate Deals", "topic": "client_disappearing", "topic_slug": "client_disappearing"}
