te-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000019", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000020", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000021", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000023", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000024", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000025", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "change the way you communicate, and this alone will change how your call ends with a book meeting or just send me some options.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000003"}], "text": "To improve client communication and increase sales."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Well, I'm not saying never ask how are you. Call two, three, ask about the wife, the kids, the dog, it works there. But on a call one,", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000005"}], "text": "Avoid asking standard opening questions such as 'how are you?' on the first call."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "You already assume that the client wants to buy.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007"}], "text": "On the first call, avoid making assumptions about the client's intentions."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "when you saw the ad, like, besides the shiny computer graphics, what was about the ad that kind of attracted", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}], "text": "Inquire about what attracted the client to the ad without assuming commitment to purchase."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Change that and the next month you will double your sales.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000002"}], "text": "Changing communication style can potentially double sales within a month."}, "title": "Changing Communication Style", "topic": "communication_style_change"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:2c58c3be1e463563", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Changing Communication Style", "topic": "communication_style_change", "topic_slug": "communication_style_change"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "You already assume that the client wants to buy.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007"}, {"quote": "the moment you say you're interested in investing in Dubai real estate, the natural reaction is to correct you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008"}], "text": "Assuming the client's interest in buying right from the initial contact can lead to lost opportunities."}, "title": "Avoid Assumptions in Initial Contact", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:7a997bc97d10fcd3", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Avoid Assumptions in Initial Contact", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions", "topic_slug": "initial_contact_assumptions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000009", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000011"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "liking Dubai is not an investment decision.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000009"}, {"quote": "the client freezes because in reality he's not maybe downtown Dubai Marina, maybe one or two more, but he doesn't have enough information to answer you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000010"}], "text": "Asking clients about their prior visits to Dubai or if they like it does not correlate directly with investment decision-making and may hinder the sales process."}, "title": "Questions that Harm Sales", "topic": "harmful_questions"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:ab45f0a57d6c497e", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Questions that Harm Sales", "topic": "harmful_questions", "topic_slug": "harmful_questions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000023", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000024"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "four things need to happen for a deal to close.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000022"}, {"quote": "the right options, not the ones you like.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000023"}, {"quote": "your first goal is not to sell the property.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000024"}], "text": "Four elements are crucial for closing a deal: internal urgency, reduced fear, suitable options, and financial capability."}, "title": "Important Sales Elements", "topic": "important_sales_elements"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:4e087c72a42c6eba", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Important Sales Elements", "topic": "important_sales_elements", "topic_slug": "important_sales_elements"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "Now, answer honestly. How often do you hear that after opening your call this way?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008"}], "text": "This assumption can lead clients to disengage due to feeling pressured too early, causing them to retreat or request more options."}, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "You already assume that the client wants to buy.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007"}], "text": "Agents often erroneously assume clients are ready to invest in real estate during initial contact."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Assumption Leading to Lost Opportunities", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:2f7d5f4345f566a2", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Assumption Leading to Lost Opportunities", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions", "topic_slug": "initial_contact_assumptions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000009", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000010"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "the client freezes because in reality he's not maybe downtown Dubai Marina, maybe one or two more, but he doesn't have enough information to answer you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000010"}], "text": "The approach leads to a stall in the conversation because the client lacks sufficient information to make a decision."}, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Many agents believe that if the client has visited or especially more than once and he says it's like it, it's it's already kind of halfway to buying.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000009"}], "text": "An agent asks a client about their familiarity and liking of Dubai to gauge investment interest."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Real Estate Client Uncertainty", "topic": "harmful_questions"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:46c5578088f96279", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Real Estate Client Uncertainty", "topic": "harmful_questions", "topic_slug": "harmful_questions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000025", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": {"citations": [{"quote": "People believe what comes from their own mouth to their own ears far more than anything you tell them.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000025"}], "text": "Real persuasion is effective when clients hear themselves verbalize their thoughts and needs."}, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "agents go wrong. They pitch too early, recommend too early, present properties before the client understands his own decisions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"}], "text": "Many agents prematurely pitch properties before clients clarify their own decisions."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "the client starts convincing himself through his own answers, not because you paychain, because he hears himself saying it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000025"}], "text": "The aim should be to assist the client in realizing their own needs through strategic conversation."}, "title": "Effective Client Engagement", "topic": "communication_style_change"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:1c9306ab28274aa7", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Effective Client Engagement", "topic": "communication_style_change", "topic_slug": "communication_style_change"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000014", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000015"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "You become interchangeable.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000015"}], "text": "Hearing similar scripts and questions across agents makes clients view new agents as interchangeable rather than experts."}, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "by the time you call that he already spoken to fifteen or twenty agents he has something close to PTSD from Dubai real estate conversations.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000014"}], "text": "Potential buyers have spoken to multiple agents receiving similar treatment and questions."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Initial Contact Strategy", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:a6ed91ae3e002e29", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Initial Contact Strategy", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions", "topic_slug": "initial_contact_assumptions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000006"], "form": "wording", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "But on a call one, A stranger asking how are you doesn't sound like a care.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000005"}, {"quote": "A stranger asking how are you doesn't sound like a care.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000006"}], "text": "While the phrase 'how are you?' is a common opening, it is criticized for lacking sincerity and serving as a segue into a sales pitch."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Opening Line Critique", "topic": "communication_style_change"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:25a7a5cf36b7045c", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Opening Line Critique", "topic": "communication_style_change", "topic_slug": "communication_style_change"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000012"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Are you looking for investment or a personal use?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000011"}], "text": "The discussions show a pattern where agents ask about interest in investment or personal use during initial contacts, but fail to derive meaningful insights from affirmative responses."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Client Interest Questions", "topic": "harmful_questions"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:da65ec3b082b5778", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Client Interest Questions", "topic": "harmful_questions", "topic_slug": "harmful_questions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008"], "form": "tone", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Are you interested in investing in Dubai real estate?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007"}], "text": "Using assumptive language that presupposes a client's intention to invest can lead to a defensive reaction from clients."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Assumptive Language During Calls", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:5dd4982f3d8af72a", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Assumptive Language During Calls", "topic": "initial_contact_assumptions", "topic_slug": "initial_contact_assumptions"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000017", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000018"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "He just added the sales techniques and the process that were missing.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000018"}], "text": "The narrative discusses transformative coaching by noting a participant's improved success through structural conversation changes rather than increased real estate knowledge."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Transformation through Coaching", "topic": "communication_style_change"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:06c82e7b5167b5e0", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Transformation through Coaching", "topic": "communication_style_change", "topic_slug": "communication_style_change"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "And don't waste time building report. Even", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"}], "text": "Agents should not waste time building rapport with clients, as it doesn't work."}, "title": "Avoid building rapport", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:59b6c40c9c69bb37", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Avoid building rapport", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "The most important thing in the start is to bring the client back to the moment his intent was the highest.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"}], "text": "Bring the client back to the moment his intent was the highest."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Looks like you responded to one of the ads and asked us to call you back, possibly looking for help with investing in Dubai real estate or the project.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}], "text": "Client has responded to an ad and asked for a call back."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "start with um hi name.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}], "text": "Start interaction with 'hi, name'."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Then ask. And when you saw the ad, like, besides the shiny computer graphics, what was about the ad that kind of attracted", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}], "text": "Ask what about the ad attracted the client."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Neutral tone, not assumptive. Then ask. And when you saw the ad, like, besides the shiny computer graphics, what was about the ad that kind of attracted", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}], "text": "Begin client interactions with a neutral, non-assumptive tone."}, "title": "Starting client interaction effectively", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:1ff4326dff7bbeb1", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Starting client interaction effectively", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "He needs to realize there is something important he doesn't yet understand about choosing the right investment", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "Lead the client to a realization about the importance of choosing the right investment"}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Create a vacuum in the client mind. He needs to realize there is something important he doesn't yet understand about choosing the right investment", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "Create a sense of missing information in the client's mind."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "and that you are the person who can help.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "Position yourself as the person who can help them understand."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Create a vacuum in the client mind. He needs to realize there is something important he doesn't yet understand about choosing the right investment", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "Create a vacuum in the client's mind to make them realize there's something important they don't understand about choosing the right investment."}, "title": "Creating a vacuum in the client's mind", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:795f9007d87503f0", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Creating a vacuum in the client's mind", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000042"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "But how to make it effective so the client believes it? There is only one way, make the client pitch Dubai to himself by himself.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041"}], "text": "Make the client believe in Dubai as the right investment."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "What makes you feel that Dubai may be the right place for your investment, rather than invest in your own country?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041"}], "text": "Ask the client why they feel Dubai may be the right place for investment."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Ask it with the right tone and listen. To buy feels more stable. Prices are growing.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000042"}], "text": "Listen to the client as they justify their interest in Dubai."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "people stay consistent with the commitment they already made.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000042"}, {"quote": "But how to make it effective so the client believes it? There is only one way, make the client pitch Dubai to himself by himself. Here's how.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041"}], "text": "Make the client pitch Dubai to themselves, as people stay consistent with the commitment they already made."}, "title": "Client must pitch Dubai to themselves", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:3427c07bc5016693", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Client must pitch Dubai to themselves", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000045"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Nobody ever told you that every part of the process matters, how you talk to people, what you send instead of the standard brochure, how you invite them to a meeting, present to buy on the map, and increase the client budget? I am telling you now.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000045"}], "text": "Every part of the sales process matters, from how you talk to people to how you present information, and handling every stage correctly makes closing simple."}, "title": "Importance of process in sales", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:7e918c7be2504450", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Importance of process in sales", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Ask one simple question. Why? And watch Hume pitch himself again, because by now you know people only believe the words coming of their own mouth to their own ears.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"}], "text": "Reinforce the client's commitment to the option."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Ask one simple question. Why?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"}], "text": "Ask the client 'why' when they say an option feels right."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "And watch Hume pitch himself again, because by now you know people only believe the words coming of their own mouth to their own ears.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"}], "text": "Listen as the client justifies their choice to themselves."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "And when the client says yes, if you trained by me, you know it's not yet time to celebrate. Ask one simple question. Why? And watch Hume pitch himself again,", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"}], "text": "When a client agrees something feels like the right option, ask them why and they will pitch themselves to it again."}, "title": "Letting the client justify the option to themselves", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:c5fe7ff44a5f67f6", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Letting the client justify the option to themselves", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Neutral tone, not assumptive. Then ask. And when you saw the ad, like, besides the shiny computer graphics, what was about the ad that kind of attracted", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}], "text": "The speaker outlines an opening structure for engaging with clients, starting with a neutral and non-assumptive tone."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Neutral tone introduction", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:9f1600baae073e90", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Neutral tone introduction", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "And when the client says yes, if you trained by me, you know it's not yet time to celebrate. Ask one simple question. Why? And watch Hume pitch himself again,", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"}], "text": "The speaker uses a rhetorical move where clients are asked 'why' after agreeing an option feels right, leading them to self-justify their choice."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Self-justification technique", "topic": "sales techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:3b83d328041f22ca", "metadata_hash": "997b4740155d775d9d6f3d09fb25e4e032f466ecd672644c7cad3096b7185642", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Self-justification technique", "topic": "sales techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
